<ContentLayout
  title="About — Calorie Calculator Free"
  h1="About Calorie Calculator Free"
  description="Learn about Calorie Calculator Free — our mission to make accurate, science-based nutrition tools available to everyone for free."
  path="/about/"
  lead="Free, accurate, science-based nutrition tools — for everyone, with no catch."
>
  <h2>Our mission</h2>
  <p>Calorie Calculator Free was built on a simple belief: everyone deserves access to accurate, easy-to-understand nutrition tools without paywalls, sign-ups, or spammy upsells. Whether you want to lose fat, build muscle, or simply understand your body better, the math should be free and the experience should be excellent.</p>

  <h2 id="experts">Medical & Expert Review Board</h2>
  <p>We understand that nutrition and health are highly personal and critical topics. That is why our tools and guides are meticulously reviewed by our Medical Review Board to ensure that the formulas we use—like the <a href="/bmr-calculator/">Mifflin-St Jeor equation</a>—and the educational content we provide meet the highest standards of evidence-based medical and nutrition science.</p>
  
  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline p-6 rounded-2xl">
    <div class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-brand/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand bg-canvas">
      <svg class="h-10 w-10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M19 8v6"></path><path d="M22 11h-6"></path></svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="!mt-0 text-lg font-bold text-ink flex items-center gap-2">Dr. Elena Rossi, MD <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-success/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-success">Medical Reviewer</span></h3>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-mute mt-1 mb-3">Board Certified Physician & Metabolic Health Specialist</p>
      <p class="text-body text-sm leading-relaxed m-0">Dr. Rossi is a board-certified physician specializing in endocrinology and metabolic health. She oversees the clinical accuracy of the calculators and health information provided on Calorie Calculator Free, ensuring all physiological models align with current medical consensus and peer-reviewed literature.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>How our calculators work</h2>
  <p>Our calculators are grounded in peer-reviewed equations used by dietitians and researchers worldwide. We use established methods like the U.S. Navy body-fat formula and the Boer lean-mass equation.</p>

  <h2>Privacy first</h2>
  <p>Every calculation runs entirely in your browser. We never send your height, weight, or health details to a server, and your recent results are stored only on your own device. You can use every tool here completely anonymously.</p>

  <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A complete <a href="/">calorie calculator</a> with goal-based targets and macros</li>
    <li>Dedicated <a href="/bmi-calculator/">BMI</a>, <a href="/tdee-calculator/">TDEE</a>, <a href="/body-fat-calculator/">body fat</a>, and 8 more calculators</li>
    <li>Plain-English <a href="/guides/how-many-calories-should-i-eat/">guides</a> on calories, macros, and weight management</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>A note on accuracy</h2>
  <p>Predictive equations are excellent starting points, but every body is different. We encourage you to use our numbers as a baseline, track your real-world results, and adjust over time. For personalized medical advice, always consult a qualified healthcare professional. You can read more about our standards in our <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a>.</p>
</ContentLayout>
